cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Super Schema, or build on it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Super Schema"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted schema management platform: design the logical shape of your
  data once and generate JSON Schema, OpenAPI, Avro, Protobuf, Java and
  database DDL from it through TypeSpec, with AsyncAPI event contracts and
  built-in governance.
authors:
